==Battleground==
*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 130 seconds<sup>3,900f</sup>, delay 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Gentleman Bros. (Enemy)|Gentleman Bros.]] spawns as the boss.
**15 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**15 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**2 [[Le'noir]]s spawn, delay 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Start off with some [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]] to stall the Doge Darks. Don't let them hit your base too much, as they deal 16,000 damage per attack.

Summon [[Li'l Nyandam (Special Cat)|Catdam]], [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun]], and any Ubers you may have. Stack [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Jamiera]], [[Crazed Titan Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Titan]], and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon]].

When you hit the base, Gentleman Bros. and Le'noir will spawn. The Le'noir is the main damager, and Gentleman Bros. is support. A second Le'noir spawns later.

[[Li'l Nyandam (Special Cat)|Catdam]] outranges the Gentleman Bros., so he's very useful for slow damage. Also drop [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] occasionally, he can deal tons of damage.

[[Radiant Aphrodite (Uber Rare Cat)|Radiant Aphrodite]] and [[The Grateful Crane (Uber Rare Cat)|Super Galaxy Cosmo]] make this stage much easier, due to their high range and ability to hit the Le'noirs in the back. However, try not to let Super Galaxy Cosmo run into a Le'noir hit.

The battle becomes much easier when you take out the Le'noir. Be patient and you should eventually win.

